 SelectionTool_List_MultiSelfContainedVeryBigFont;globalParms;list;parms;n1;flag;boolean
⍝ Presents a list of any length and allows selecting of multiple rows with a big font
 globalParms←##.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalParms.regKey←'MyApp'
 globalParms.caption←'My App'
 globalParms.icon←#.⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 #.⎕SHADOW'MyFonts'
 #.MyFonts←∆CreateFonts 48
 globalParms.(fontStandard fontInput fontLabel fontAPL)←#.MyFonts.(standard input label apl)

 list←((⊂'. '),¨⍨⍕¨⍳200),¨200⍴#.⎕NL-3
 parms←##.GUI.SelectionTool.CreateParms
 parms.caption←'Select from list'
 parms.colTitles←⊂'Numbers'
 parms.style←##.GUI.Enums.SelectionStyles.multi
 parms.info←'Select as many items from the list as you like:'

 parms.default←{⍵∊110 112 114}⍳⍴list
 n1←globalParms parms ##.GUI.SelectionTool.Create list

 (flag boolean)←##.GUI.SelectionTool.ModalWait n1
 :If flag
     ⎕←' User pressed the OK button'
     ⎕←⍪boolean/list
 :Else
     ⎕←'User did NOT press the OK button'
 :EndIf
